# Day 20

**23km / 6 hours**

This wasn't as exciting a day but it did feature a nice pit stop at a town in the morning which was convenient for picking up lunch. It began on the beach then found its way on to a road walk but it had a side walk or path for most of it so wasn't especially taxing. The road then went up into the Brynderwyn hills.

![The view from the cloudy hills](./cloudy-view.jpg)

It was a bit wet and the showers were on and off which wasn't that pleasant but I kept going to the nice enough campsite. 